<p>Wisely, the table chef kept his thoughts to himself.</p>

<img src="Chef.jpg" alt="This kind of thing never happen in Japan.">

<p>The result was our <i>first family photo</i>&hellip;and everyone in this picture, 
has been in many more since as our family has been extended to include my other 
two children, Michael's sisters and their families, Barbara and her husband and 
their families, and more. I know it sounds corny, but it's true nonetheless: 
There is always room at Love's table.</p>

